滞</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="45.845" end="47.225"><span begin="45.845" end="46.115">(No</span> <span begin="46.115" end="47.225">time)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">分秒不待</span></span></p><p begin="47.455" end="53.945" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.455" end="47.585">I</span> <span begin="47.585" end="47.925">get</span> <span begin="47.925" end="48.695">mine</span> <span begin="48.695" end="48.895">and</span> <span begin="48.895" end="49.165">make</span> <span begin="49.165" end="49.535">no</span> <span begin="49.535" end="49.605">ex</span><span begin="49.605" end="49.975">cus</span><span begin="49.975" end="50.525">es</span> <span begin="50.525" end="51.005">waste</span> <span begin="51.005" end="51.195">of</span> <span begin="51.195" end="51.565">pre</span><span begin="51.565" end="51.765">cious</span> <span begin="51.765" end="52.595">breath</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我自取所需也从不借口开脱 那不过是虚耗口舌</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="52.595" end="53.945"><span begin="52.595" end="52.855">(No</span> <span begin="52.855" end="53.945">time)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">刻不容缓</span></span></p><p begin="54.165" end="56.495" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.165" end="54.275">The</span> <span begin="54.275" end="54.655">sun</span> <span begin="54.655" end="55.465">shines</span> <span begin="55.465" end="55.675">on</span> <span begin="55.675" end="55.825">ev</span><span begin="55.825" end="56.025">ery</span><span begin="56.025" end="56.495">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光普照在这芸芸众生</span></p><p begin="56.495" end="59.554" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.495" end="56.645">Ev</span><span begin="56.645" end="56.835">ery</span><span begin="56.835" end="57.225">one,</span> <span begin="57.225" end="57.665">love</span> <span begin="57.665" end="57.825">your</span><span begin="57.825" end="58.325">self</span> <span begin="58.325" end="58.535">to</span> <span begin="58.535" end="59.554">death</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世人啊 至死方休地溺爱自己吧</span></p><p begin="59.315" end="1:02.915" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.315" end="59.545">So</span> <span begin="59.545" end="59.715">you</span> <span begin="59.715" end="1:00.105">gotta</span> <span begin="1:00.105" end="1:00.615">fire</span> <span begin="1:00.615" end="1:00.785">up,</span> <span begin="1:01.295" end="1:01.465">you</span> <span begin="1:01.465" end="1:01.885">gotta</span> <span begin="1:01.885" end="1:02.275">let</span> <span begin="1:02.275" end="1:02.915">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就燃起怒火 放手一搏</span></p><p begin="1:02.915" end="1:06.325" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.915" end="1:03.145">You&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:03.145" end="1:03.445">nev</span><span begin="1:03.445" end="1:03.525">er</span> <span begin="1:03.525" end="1:03.835">be</span> <span begin="1:03.835" end="1:04.385">loved</span> <span begin="1:04.385" end="1:04.635">&apos;til</span> <span begin="1:04.635" end="1:04.835">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:04.835" end="1:05.235">made</span> <span begin="1:05.235" end="1:05.735">your</span> <span begin="1:05.735" end="1:06.325">own</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有亲手开拓 才配拥抱所爱</span></p><p begin="1:06.325" end="1:09.675" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.325" end="1:06.485">You</span> <span begin="1:06.485" end="1:06.825">gotta</span> <span begin="1:06.825" end="1:07.385">face</span> <span begin="1:07.385" end="1:07.805">up,</span> <span begin="1:08.035" end="1:08.195">you</span> <span begin="1:08.195" end="1:08.575">gotta</span> <span begin="1:08.575" end="1:08.965">get</span> <span begin="1:08.965" end="1:09.675">yours</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直面这一切 夺回属于你的天地</span></p><p begin="1:09.515" end="1:13.305" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.515" end="1:09.835">You</span> <span begin="1:09.835" end="1:10.125">nev</span><span begin="1:10.125" end="1:10.225">er</span> <span begin="1:10.225" end="1:10.515">know</span> <span begin="1:10.515" end="1:10.645">the</span> <span begin="1:10.645" end="1:11.075">top</span> <span begin="1:11.075" end="1:11.335">&apos;til</span> <span begin="1:11.335" end="1:11.515">you</span> <span begin="1:11.515" end="1:11.935">get</span> <span begin="1:11.935" end="1:12.295">too</span> <span begin="1:12.295" end="1:13.305">low</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若未尝跌落深渊 又怎知何为峰巅</span></p><p begin="1:14.385" end="1:17.445" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.385" end="1:14.715">A</span> <span begin="1:14.715" end="1:15.225">son</span> <span begin="1:15.225" end="1:15.415">of</span> <span begin="1:15.415" end="1:15.985">a</span> <span begin="1:15.985" end="1:16.455">step</span><span begin="1:16.455" end="1:17.035">fa</span><span begin="1:17.035" end="1:17.445">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继父膝下的桀骜逆子</span></p><p begin="1:17.795" end="1:20.825" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.795" end="1:18.105">A</span> <span begin="1:18.105" end="1:18.595">son</span> <span begin="1:18.595" end="1:18.765">of</span> <span begin="1:18.765" end="1:19.085">a—,</span> <span begin="1:19.085" end="1:19.425">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:19.425" end="1:19.825">so</span> <span begin="1:19.825" end="1:20.465">sor</span><span begin="1:20.465" end="1:20.825">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身世如谜 我深感抱歉</span></p><p begin="1:21.185" end="1:24.205" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.185" end="1:21.435">A</span> <span begin="1:21.435" end="1:21.965">son</span> <span begin="1:21.965" end="1:22.145">of</span> <span begin="1:22.145" end="1:22.725">a</span> <span begin="1:22.725" end="1:23.195">step</span><span begin="1:23.195" end="1:23.755">fa</span><span begin="1:23.755" end="1:24.205">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寄于继父门下的悖逆孤雏</span></p><p begin="1:24.545" end="1:27.595" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.545" end="1:24.805">A</span> <span begin="1:24.805" end="1:25.305">son</span> <span begin="1:25.305" end="1:25.475">of</span> <span begin="1:25.475" end="1:25.845">a—,</span> <span begin="1:25.845" end="1:26.125">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:26.125" end="1:26.535">so</span> <span begin="1:26.535" end="1:27.245">sor</span><span begin="1:27.245" end="1:27.595">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无处容身 我满怀愧意</span></p><p begin="1:27.845" end="1:30.885" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.845" end="1:28.265">No</span> <span begin="1:28.265" end="1:29.075">lies</span> <span begin="1:29.075" end="1:29.265">and</span> <span begin="1:29.265" end="1:29.635">no</span> <span begin="1:29.635" end="1:29.895">de</span><span begin="1:29.895" end="1:30.455">ceiv</span><span begin="1:30.455" end="1:30.885">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">褪去谎言 撕下伪装</span></p><p begin="1:30.885" end="1:33.285" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.885" end="1:31.305">Man</span> <span begin="1:31.305" end="1:31.495">is</span> <span begin="1:31.495" end="1:31.765">what</span> <span begin="1:31.765" end="1:32.035">he</span> <span begin="1:32.035" end="1:33.285">loves</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心之所向 塑我之魂</span></p><p begin="1:34.535" end="1:40.995" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.535" end="1:34.575">I</span> <span begin="1:34.575" end="1:34.995">keep</span> <span begin="1:34.995" end="1:35.895">tryin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:35.895" end="1:36.295">to</span> <span begin="1:36.295" end="1:36.515">con</span><span begin="1:36.515" end="1:37.195">ceive</span> <span begin="1:37.195" end="1:37.595">that</span> <span begin="1:37.595" end="1:38.075">death</span> <span begin="1:38.075" end="1:38.265">is</span> <span begin="1:38.265" end="1:38.555">from</span> <span begin="1:38.555" end="1:39.575">above</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我苦苦参悟 死神自苍穹俯瞰降临</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:39.575" end="1:40.995"><span begin="1:39.575" end="1:39.905">(No</span> <span begin="1:39.905" end="1:40.995">time)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大限将至</span></span></p><p begin="1:41.235" end="1:47.745" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.235" end="1:41.365">I</span> <span begin="1:41.365" end="1:41.705">get</span> <span begin="1:41.705" end="1:42.475">mine</span> <span begin="1:42.475" end="1:42.665">and</span> <span begin="1:42.665" end="1:42.955">make</span> <span begin="1:42.955" end="1:43.315">no</span> <span begin="1:43.315" end="1:43.385">ex</span><span begin="1:43.385" end="1:43.755">cus</span><span begin="1:43.755" end="1:44.305">es</span> <span begin="1:44.305" end="1:44.785">waste</span> <span begin="1:44.785" end="1:44.975">of</span> <span begin="1:44.975" end="1:45.345">pre</span><span begin="1:45.345" end="1:45.545">cious</span> <span begin="1:45.545" end="1:46.375">breath</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我领受命运也绝不辩解 那纯属徒费唇舌</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:46.375" end="1:47.745"><span begin="1:46.375" end="1:46.645">(No</span> <span begin="1:46.645" end="1:47.745">time)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时不我与</span></span></p><p begin="1:47.955" end="1:50.275" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.955" end="1:48.055">The</span> <span begin="1:48.055" end="1:48.435">sun</span> <span begin="1:48.435" end="1:49.245">shines</span> <span begin="1:49.245" end="1:49.455">on</span> <span begin="1:49.455" end="1:49.605">ev</span><span begin="1:49.605" end="1:49.805">ery</span><span begin="1:49.805" end="1:50.275">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烈日平等映照万物苍生</span></p><p begin="1:50.275" end="1:53.095" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.275" end="1:50.42